<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Corrections Corp started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Corrections Corp started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Wasserstein Perella said it initiated coverage of Corrections Corp of America with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $0.72 per share for 1997 and $1.20 for 1998, compared to $0.37 for 1996.</p>
<p>-- said &quot;premier operator&quot; in private corrections &quot;will continue to transform the nation's prison system over the next three to five years.&quot;</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target of $42.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-7/8 to 28-7/8.</p>
</text>
